EST-AUDIT.md F116). R.C.C. Bonuses: see Natural Abilities, which print none. hand_to_hand costs {}: the race grants no Hand to Hand and its pick categories offer none. Halved attacks, bonuses and Spd away from the sun are conditional and prose. || SKILLS: Preserve Foods, Lore: Cattle/Animals, Astronomy, Basic Math and Camouflage at a flat 70% +2% per level, stored as Preserve Food, Lore: Cattle & Animals, Astronomy and Mathematics: Basic base 70 per_level 2. Preserve Plants & Fruits has no catalog row and is a special ability at the same figure. Natural Affinity''s Botany and Identify Plants and Animals at 80% +1% are granted as Botany and Identify Plants & Fruit, the catalog''s nearest row. || PICKS: five from Navigation skills (any, including Land Navigation), any Lore, any Language (-5%) and any Science (+5%) are occ_related_skills count 5, the categories scoped by name since the catalog files Lore and Language under Technical and Cowboy and Navigation under Pilot Related and Wilderness. One more at levels 4 and 8 is the schedule; 16 and 24 lie past the ladder (F116). The book lets those later picks include W.P. Ancient; the schedule cannot carry its own categories, so the W.P. Ancient list is in the categories and its later-only rule is a restriction line. || EQUIPMENT: every item is a may-have, so none is granted; the list is a restriction line. Money: none. || NOT STORED: size, weight, life span, habitat, value (1D6x10,000 credits), allies and enemies are in the body."
